///   hang and crash switches of the failure drills. The port table, the manifest builder and the
///   dispatch bindings come from the generated header (R-SIM-22). Filled in by lab_tools.generate.
/// @author Pavan Karimajji <Pavan.Karimajji@larsentoubro.com>

